{
  "_comment": [
    "generated: lib/gen_mixnet.py --base experiments/mix-over-delivery/manifests/mix-disco-rln-smoke-keyrotation-hold.json --mix 20 --senders 8 --receivers 4 --count 850 --interval 20 --send-after 1200 --image logos-sim:run10-long-rln --duration 18600 --allocator-funding 1000000000000 --spread",
    "Run 10: the 10-smoke-e build and setup (mix key rotation, held first advert, rendezvous off, Kademlia service discovery only, Relay RLN and Mix RLN on two registries, every membership from the allocator) at 20 module mix nodes, 8 Core senders (Required, they mix too: pool 28), 4 receivers, for 5 h 10 min.",
    "Duration 18600 s from T0: nodes start at about T0+1-3 min, keys rotate at 60/120/180/240 min and are destroyed at 165/225/285 min after start, so the third key's expiry (about T0+288 min) is followed by 22 min of traffic.",
    "Senders start 1200 s after subscribing (about T0+21-23 min): the first 20 minutes are warm-up. 850 sends at 20 s each end about T0+305 min, 5 minutes before the end.",
    "network.spread: mix nodes and members get the addresses with the shortest shared prefixes inside 10/8 (manifest.spread_addresses): longest prefix shared with another advertiser 13 bits instead of up to 31, modelled first-advert wait 338-366 s instead of 338-872 s.",
    "ALLOCATOR_FUNDING 1e12 (default 2e11) for 60 registrations; the genesis payer holds 1e13 (docker/lez.py).",
    "COLLECT_LOGS=all HARNESS_MANIFEST=<this file> ./harness.sh run \"\" out/collect/run10-long"
  ],
